<===> README.md
Continuation lines of multi-line comments are re-indented like dart-sass:
the smallest indentation of the following lines (at most the column the
comment starts at) is replaced by the output indentation. Continuation
lines of trailing comments get no indentation. Expected output generated
with dart-sass 1.93.1.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> media/input.scss
@media screen {
  .x {
    /* in media
       seven
    */
    y: z;
  }
}
<===> media/output.css
@media screen {
  .x {
    /* in media
       seven
    */
    y: z;
  }
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> nested/input.scss
a {
  /* nested
     three
     three */
  b: c;
}
<===> nested/output.css
a {
  /* nested
     three
     three */
  b: c;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> nested_deeper_start/input.scss
a {
  b: c;
      /* deep start
    four
         nine
      */
  d: e;
}
<===> nested_deeper_start/output.css
a {
  b: c;
  /* deep start
  four
       nine
    */
  d: e;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> preserved/input.scss
/*!
 * preserved
 *
 *   indented
 */
a {b: c}
<===> preserved/output.css
/*!
 * preserved
 *
 *   indented
 */
a {
  b: c;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> top_level/input.scss
/* ==========
   #TOP
   ========== */
a {b: c}
<===> top_level/output.css
/* ==========
   #TOP
   ========== */
a {
  b: c;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> top_level_less_indented/input.scss
/* first
  two
    four
*/
a {b: c}
<===> top_level_less_indented/output.css
/* first
  two
    four
*/
a {
  b: c;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> trailing/input.scss
a {
  b: c; /* trailing
     five */
  d: e;
}
<===> trailing/output.css
a {
  b: c; /* trailing
five */
  d: e;
}
